# Coding Standards

Use strict TypeScript.

Never use any.

Use Zod validation.

Use Prisma.

Use Repository pattern.

Use Service layer.

Use Dependency Injection where appropriate.

Keep AI separate from business logic.

Write reusable functions.

Keep nodes small.

One responsibility per node.

