# Primary Objective

This project is intended to demonstrate production-level AI engineering using LangGraph.

The focus should be on:

- Multi-agent orchestration
- Tool calling
- Structured outputs
- Natural language understanding
- Clean architecture
- Scalable TypeScript backend
- Real-world business logic

Avoid building a generic chatbot.

Instead, build an AI employee that understands user requests and performs real application actions.